{
 "titulo": "Why Elevators Used to Fall",
 "set": "Almacén de Nueva York, 1850: ladrillo, vigas de madera y latón",
 "voz": {
  "voice_id": "English_FriendlyPerson",
  "speed": 1.0,
  "alternativas": [
   "English_magnetic_voiced_man",
   "English_Trustworth_Man"
  ]
 },
 "resaltar": [
  "Elisha",
  "Otis",
  "Otis,",
  "1852",
  "1854",
  "redundancy",
  "New",
  "York",
  "governor"
 ],
 "frases": [
  {
   "texto": "Elevators used to hang from a single rope.",
   "version": "cuerda",
   "tomas": [
    "orbita_inicio",
    "cuerda_macro"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "crujido",
     "palabra": "rope."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "If it snapped, everyone inside fell.",
   "version": "cuerda",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "rotura",
     "palabra": "snapped,"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "chasquido",
     "palabra": "snapped,"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "golpe",
     "palabra": "fell.",
     "retraso": 0.5
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "cuerda_macro",
    "caida"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "So, builders switched to stronger iron wire rope.",
   "version": "alambre",
   "tomas": [
    "cable_subida"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "clic",
     "palabra": "wire"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "But, wire still wears out, and when it broke there was nothing to stop the fall.",
   "version": "alambre",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "desgaste",
     "palabra": "wears"
    },
    {
     "evento": "rotura",
     "palabra": "broke"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "chasquido",
     "palabra": "broke"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "golpe",
     "palabra": "stop",
     "retraso": 0.3
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "cable_macro",
    "caida"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "So, in 1852, Elisha Otis added a safety brake.",
   "version": "otis",
   "tomas": [
    "orbita_otis"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "ding",
     "palabra": "brake."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "A steel spring sat on top of the car, held flat by the pull of the rope.",
   "version": "otis",
   "tomas": [
    "muelle_macro",
    "muelle_lado"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "The rails on each side were covered in teeth.",
   "version": "otis",
   "tomas": [
    "dientes"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "trinquete",
     "palabra": "teeth."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "If the rope snapped, the spring snapped open and locked into the teeth.",
   "version": "otis",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "rotura",
     "palabra": "snapped,"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "chasquido",
     "palabra": "snapped,"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "resorte",
     "palabra": "open"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "clank",
     "palabra": "locked"
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "muelle_macro",
    "traba_macro"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "In 1854, Otis rode his own elevator in New York and had the rope cut in front of a crowd.",
   "version": "otis_feria",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "rotura",
     "palabra": "cut"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "hacha",
     "palabra": "cut"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "clank",
     "palabra": "front"
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "feria",
    "cuerda_corte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "He didn't fall.",
   "version": "otis_feria",
   "tomas": [
    "sombrero"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "ding",
     "palabra": "fall."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "But, his brake only worked if the rope broke completely.",
   "version": "motor",
   "tomas": [
    "muelle_lado"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "If the motor failed and the car simply ran too fast, nothing caught it.",
   "version": "motor",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "embalado",
     "palabra": "failed"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "zumbido",
     "palabra": "failed"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "golpe",
     "palabra": "caught"
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "tambor",
    "caida"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "So, engineers added a spinning governor.",
   "version": "regulador",
   "tomas": [
    "regulador"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "giro",
     "palabra": "spinning"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "When the car goes too fast, the weights fly outward and trigger the brake.",
   "version": "regulador",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "embalado",
     "palabra": "goes"
    },
    {
     "evento": "bolas",
     "palabra": "fly"
    },
    {
     "evento": "freno",
     "palabra": "trigger"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "clank",
     "palabra": "trigger"
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "regulador_macro",
    "traba_macro"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "Finally, elevators stopped trusting any single part.",
   "version": "moderno",
   "tomas": [
    "estante"
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "That is redundancy.",
   "version": "moderno",
   "tomas": [
    "cables_moderno"
   ],
   "efectos": [
    {
     "sfx": "ding",
     "palabra": "redundancy."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "texto": "Today, your elevator hangs from several steel cables, and each one is strong enough to hold the car by itself.",
   "version": "moderno",
   "efectos": [
    {
     "evento": "cortes_modernos",
     "palabra": "each"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "chasquido",
     "palabra": "each"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "chasquido",
     "palabra": "strong"
    },
    {
     "sfx": "chasquido",
     "palabra": "hold"
    }
   ],
   "tomas": [
    "cables_macro",
    "cables_moderno",
    "loop_final"
   ]
  }
 ]
}